        {
          "name": "Longshot_Studio",
          "minimumCommit": "6b9dce6ed6d85e762efc14416f9936780488442a",
          "requiredClasses": []
        }
      ],
      "notes": "Optional upstream application by r34vtraining. Setup downloads the original repositories on request; no upstream code is bundled or patched. Restart ComfyUI after installation. H3 model files and FFmpeg are also required; Turbo, RTX VSR and RefMods are upstream optional extensions."
